<title>USA: UCAR to buy part German electrode unit.</title>
<headline>UCAR to buy part German electrode unit.</headline>
<dateline>DANBURY, Conn. 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>UCAR International Inc said on Wednesday it reached an agreement to acquire at least 70 percent ownership in the graphics electrode business of Elektrokohle Lichtenberg AG for about $1.8 million.</p>
<p>The company said it expected this acquisition plus a previously announced deal in Russia to add between $0.01 and $0.05 per share to 1997 earnings.</p>
